---
import { profile } from '../../data/profile';
import Container from '../ui/Container.astro';
import Section from '../ui/Section.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../ui/SectionHeading.astro';
---

<Section id="about">
  <Container>
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <SectionHeading eyebrow="About" title="From information systems to applied AI." />
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-[var(--color-fg-muted)] leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Asiimwe Ronald is a software engineer and postgraduate Artificial Intelligence student with a
          background in Information Systems and Technology. His experience spans software development, IT
          administration, web application development, database systems, and technology-driven organizational
          solutions.
        </p>
        <p>
          He has delivered production-oriented web systems — including inventory management for a
          manufacturing organization and food-ordering workflows for a ministry — and has led technology
          strategy for initiatives at the intersection of IoT, agriculture, and water security.
        </p>
        <p>
          His professional development is now focused on combining strong software engineering foundations
          with artificial intelligence and machine learning: supervised and ensemble learning, model
          evaluation, generative AI, retrieval-augmented generation, and responsible AI. He is pursuing a
          Master of Artificial Intelligence at NUIST under the 2026 China MOFCOM Scholarship.
        </p>
        <p>
          Long term, he is interested in engineering reliable, efficient, and practical intelligent systems
          that solve real-world problems, particularly in energy, agriculture, and software platforms for
          Africa.
        </p>
        <blockquote class="border-l-2 border-[var(--color-accent)] pl-5 text-[var(--color-fg)] italic">
          {profile.philosophy}
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Section>
